## Deployment

Deployed to AWS Lambda (Function URL, no API Gateway/ALB) behind the
[`lambda-web-app`](https://github.com/<you>/terraform-modules/tree/main/modules/lambda-web-app)
Terraform module{% if needs_datastore %}, with data in DynamoDB via
[`dynamodb-single-table`](https://github.com/<you>/terraform-modules/tree/main/modules/dynamodb-single-table){% endif %}.
Stays inside AWS Always Free.

```bash
cd terraform
terraform init
terraform apply
```

See `terraform/README.md` for required SSM parameters before the first apply.
{% else -%}
